@startuml SSD_UC003_Select_Avoidance_Direction_Without_Right_Sensor
hide footbox
title SSD - UC-003 Select Avoidance Direction - Without Right Sensor

actor "Sensor Input" as Sensor
participant "RVC SW Controller" as System
actor "Driving Device" as Drive

Sensor -> System: reportLeftObstacleState(leftObstacleDetected)
activate System

alt left open
    System -> Drive: turnLeft()
    note right of System: Left avoidance is selected first;\nright probe is not performed.
else left blocked and right probe front clear
    System -> Drive: turnRight90()
    Sensor -> System: reportFrontObstacleState(frontObstacleDetected=false)
    note right of System: Previous right direction is open;\nuse current heading as right avoidance.
    note right of System: Continue with UC-004.
else left blocked and right probe front blocked
    System -> Drive: turnRight90()
    Sensor -> System: reportFrontObstacleState(frontObstacleDetected=true)
    System -> Drive: turnLeft90()
    note right of System: Return to original heading.
    note right of System: Continue with UC-005.
end
deactivate System
@enduml
